# notes a touch early (after the count-in's last click) reach the take in every way of starting it:
# REPLACE over an old take, the two-step REC ARM, another track
# 1: REPLACE
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
expect nev 0
expect recording 0
expect playing 0
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
turn K2 1
turn K2 -1
wait 50
recmode 1
tap REC
wait 3600
key w0 down 90
wait 200
key w0 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 300
expect events 4
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap REC
wait 2800
key w2 down 100
wait 100
key w2 up
wait 50
key w4 down 100
wait 600
expect recording 1
key w4 up
wait 4000
tap REC
wait 200
expect events 8
expect firstpos 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
# 2: REC ARM, two steps
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
expect nev 0
expect recording 0
expect playing 0
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
turn K2 1
turn K2 -1
wait 50
recarm 1
tap REC
wait 200
expect armed 1
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect armed 0
wait 2400
key w2 down 100
wait 100
key w2 up
wait 50
key w4 down 100
wait 600
expect recording 1
key w4 up
wait 1000
tap REC
wait 200
expect events 8
expect firstpos 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
# 3: another track (the second) selected: the early notes go to it
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
expect nev 0
expect recording 0
expect playing 0
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
turn K2 1
turn K2 -1
wait 50
recarm 0
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
press HOME
tapkey b1
release HOME
wait 50
tap REC
wait 200
expect counting >0
wait 2200
key w2 down 100
wait 100
key w2 up
wait 50
key w4 down 100
wait 600
expect recording 1
key w4 up
wait 1000
tap REC
wait 200
expect events 8
expect firstpos 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
